#: ../guide/concepts.md:1 ffe3879077964188b13959e3429b301e
msgid "Concepts"
msgstr "核心概念"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:3 033a72d52eaf478795ab811bdebfd74a
msgid ""
"QTrade is a small library, but understanding how its components fit "
"together makes both the API and the source code easier to navigate. This "
"page is the mental model."
msgstr ""
"QTrade 体量不大，但理清各组件之间的关系会让 API 和源码都好读得多。"
"本页提供整体的心智模型。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:7 4e1df7d5301c47f4984aeb00bc0d8aa7
msgid "The pieces"
msgstr "组件构成"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:37 8921c22d865246b5b67bb99e1e893139
msgid ""
"For RL workflows, replace `Backtest` with `TradingEnv` — same `Broker` "
"underneath, just driven by Gymnasium's `step()` instead of a Python `for`"
" loop."
msgstr ""
"做强化学习时，把 `Backtest` 换成 `TradingEnv` —— 底层是相同的 `Broker`，"
"只是驱动方式从 Python `for` 循环换成了 Gymnasium 的 `step()`。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:41 2c5742324e1b4fee8cda2b8cc9a9ac94
msgid "What each component does"
msgstr "每个组件做什么"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:43 a144555d990f4cad8604a115b6e0bcd9
msgid "Broker"
msgstr "Broker"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:45 2d7f638c9526488aa04410ca7d579c5e
msgid ""
"The simulation core. You don't usually instantiate it directly — both "
"`Backtest` and `TradingEnv` create one for you."
msgstr ""
"模拟核心。你通常不会直接实例化它 —— `Backtest` 和 `TradingEnv` 都会自动创建。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:48 38d098e67fa2450ea1fb648843ea77d8
msgid "The Broker:"
msgstr "Broker 负责："

#: ../guide/concepts.md:49 02358f3a68d744d8a40840d516362918
msgid ""
"Holds the OHLCV data (single asset or `dict[str, DataFrame]` for "
"portfolios)"
msgstr ""
"保存 OHLCV 数据（单资产或多资产的 `dict[str, DataFrame]`）"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:50 edf96549986746d79e7fe23b290bd9c0
msgid "Tracks `cash`, computes `equity`, `unrealized_pnl`, `available_margin`"
msgstr "跟踪 `cash`，计算 `equity`、`unrealized_pnl`、`available_margin`"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:51 93a5fae9e8c64325a1a9819ac9379ab7
msgid "Maintains queues of pending / executing / filled / closed orders"
msgstr "维护 pending / executing / filled / closed 几个订单队列"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:52 dd0a4945c3fd474e954a12ca5568f529
msgid "Triggers SL / TP exits per bar"
msgstr "每个 bar 检查止损 / 止盈触发"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:53 d78379b8369445139304d09006de9c6b
msgid "Owns one `Position` per asset"
msgstr "每个资产持有一个 `Position`"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:54 a600376f08b44f6890fdc273e7ac9565
msgid "Records the portfolio-level `equity_history` Series"
msgstr "记录组合级别的 `equity_history` Series"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:56 7b70b83417cc4afd9fa57f758de20069
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Order"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:58 a46c9926d44b483bb06fb73624cd1b65
msgid ""
"A trade *intention* — what you'd like to do. Created with a signed size "
"(positive = buy, negative = sell), optional `limit` / `stop` / `sl` / "
"`tp` / `tag`, and an `asset` symbol. Orders go through the broker's "
"queues and either fill or get rejected (typically for insufficient "
"margin)."
msgstr ""
"交易 *意图* —— 你想做什么。用带符号的 size 创建（正 = 买，负 = 卖），"
"可选 `limit` / `stop` / `sl` / `tp` / `tag` 以及 `asset` 资产代码。"
"订单进入 broker 的队列后，要么成交，要么被拒（通常是保证金不足）。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:63 5c0a2b48e69e42eab9c849c795c33d65
msgid "Trade"
msgstr "Trade"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:65 687bb250291f46e39b7ce31640ac30cf
msgid ""
"A *filled* position. Each Order that fills opens (or partially closes) a "
"Trade. While open, the Trade has `entry_price`, `entry_date`, `size`, "
"optional `sl` / `tp`. When the Trade is closed (by an opposite-side "
"order, an SL/TP trigger, or end-of-backtest), it gets `exit_price`, "
"`exit_date`, `profit`, and an `exit_reason`."
msgstr ""
"一笔已*成交*的仓位。每笔成交 Order 会开仓（或部分平仓）一个 Trade。"
"开仓时 Trade 有 `entry_price`、`entry_date`、`size`，可选 `sl` / `tp`。"
"Trade 平仓后（由反向订单、SL/TP 触发或回测结束触发），会得到 `exit_price`、"
"`exit_date`、`profit` 和 `exit_reason`。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:71 b99da8912c50445a8f54137c997cd77b
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Position"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:73 01402da0d4884057874fba94b73887c1
msgid ""
"A holder for trades on one asset. `active_trades` are open; "
"`closed_trades` are closed. `position.size` is the net signed size across"
" all active trades on that asset."
msgstr ""
"某个资产上 trades 的容器。`active_trades` 是开仓中的，`closed_trades` 是已平仓的。"
"`position.size` 是该资产所有 active trades 的净有符号 size。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:77 66e13c4b7d5041a5865a6a3c00801f4a
msgid ""
"For multi-asset, the Broker holds `positions: dict[str, Position]` — one "
"per asset. `broker.position` (singular) is a convenience accessor that "
"only works in single-asset mode."
msgstr ""
"多资产模式下，Broker 持有 `positions: dict[str, Position]` —— 每个资产一个。"
"`broker.position`（单数）是单资产模式专用的便捷访问器。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:81 217b61e3978a4eadaefce675175ce8be
msgid "Strategy"
msgstr "Strategy"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:83 1d77634608304bfbbf80bd9543100b00
msgid "The piece you write. Subclass `qtrade.backtest.Strategy` and implement:"
msgstr "你需要自己写的那部分。继承 `qtrade.backtest.Strategy` 并实现："

#: ../guide/concepts.md:85 2b50df2cacbe4a10b4f34403f108db3a
msgid "`prepare()` — runs once before the bar loop. Add indicators here."
msgstr "`prepare()` —— 在 bar 循环开始前调用一次。在这里加指标。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:86 4a35fa4534b14c9994547d79f8b50fd2
msgid "`on_bar_close()` — called on every bar. Place orders, manage positions."
msgstr "`on_bar_close()` —— 每根 bar 调用一次。下单和管理仓位的地方。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:88 b0d7abcffaeb49df82f816bdde170eeb
msgid "Inside `on_bar_close()` you have:"
msgstr "在 `on_bar_close()` 内部你可以使用："

#: ../guide/concepts.md:89 3a0968fbea124e62b51a1b061a3f3804
msgid ""
"`self.data` (single-asset) / `self.data_by_asset[asset]` (multi-asset) — "
"the OHLCV slice up to the current bar."
msgstr ""
"`self.data`（单资产）/ `self.data_by_asset[asset]`（多资产）—— "
"从开始到当前 bar 的 OHLCV 切片。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:91 8d04d8a94c274830aaf0d44a92ac7878
msgid "`self.position` / `self.positions[asset]` — current holdings."
msgstr "`self.position` / `self.positions[asset]` —— 当前持仓。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:92 00319dab018d4bb38593a984e2efe488
msgid "`self.equity`, `self.unrealized_pnl` — portfolio-level snapshots."
msgstr "`self.equity`、`self.unrealized_pnl` —— 组合级快照。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:93 6730e8fa459741ffad3a26b519190b4e
msgid "`self.buy(...)`, `self.sell(...)`, `self.close(...)` — order helpers."
msgstr "`self.buy(...)`、`self.sell(...)`、`self.close(...)` —— 下单辅助方法。"

