msgid "Check SL / TP on every active trade — close any that triggered."
msgstr "对每笔 active trade 检查 SL / TP —— 触发的就平仓。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:132 70e1f60721a14a6d9ca300ccfc60e2df
msgid "Process pending stop / limit orders."
msgstr "处理 pending 队列里的 stop / limit 订单。"

