msgstr "用新 bar 的 equity 更新 `equity_history`。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:134 89b9e2c463014609ae5a61c95a18733a
msgid ""
"`Strategy.on_bar_close()` runs — you can read `self.data` (truncated to "
"*i*) and place new orders. New orders fill immediately if "
"`trade_on_close=True`, otherwise queue for next bar's open."
msgstr ""
"`Strategy.on_bar_close()` 运行 —— 你可以读 `self.data`（截到 *i*）并下新单。"
"如果 `trade_on_close=True`，新单立即成交；否则进入队列等下一根 bar 开盘。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:138 3804a5ce68a04ad3b28307c61e6dfe63
msgid ""
"After the final bar, `Broker.close_all_positions()` flushes everything at"
" the last bar's close."
msgstr ""
"最后一根 bar 之后，`Broker.close_all_positions()` 用最后一根 bar 的 close 价"
"清掉所有未平仓位。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:141 9fdbf7993f2b4a85a7d08b8f4525b5ac
msgid "Key design choices (and why)"
msgstr "关键设计选择（以及原因）"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:143 f8d65e8841964188b5404e8464debd40
msgid ""
"**Event-loop, not vectorized.** Strategy code reads like real trading "
"logic (`if x then buy`). Easier to write, easier to debug. Slower than "
"vectorbt for huge sweeps — see "
"[COMPARISON.md](https://github.com/gguan/qtrade/blob/main/COMPARISON.md)."
msgstr ""
"**事件循环，而非向量化**。策略代码读起来就是真实的交易逻辑（`if x then buy`）。"
"更好写、更好调试。在大规模参数扫描场景比 vectorbt 慢 —— "
"参见 [COMPARISON.md](https://github.com/gguan/qtrade/blob/main/COMPARISON.md)。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:146 44521fb4ea4e44e6aeb89017f395174d
msgid ""
"**No look-ahead by construction.** `self.data` is sliced to "
"`[:current_time]`. You literally cannot read future bars from inside "
"`on_bar_close()`."
msgstr ""
"**结构上杜绝未来函数**。`self.data` 被切片到 `[:current_time]`，"
"你在 `on_bar_close()` 里根本读不到未来 bar。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:149 c4e7dd73731f4750b63099feab58b9ff
msgid ""
"**One cash pool, per-asset positions.** Multi-asset backtests get "
"realistic portfolio behavior (margin shared across assets) without having"
" to manage N independent brokers."
msgstr ""
"**一个现金池 + 各资产独立持仓**。多资产回测获得真实的组合行为（保证金跨资产共享），"
"不必管理 N 个独立的 broker。"

#: ../guide/concepts.md:152 e90ec7e4872a453e9b8a0170d648ce1a
msgid ""
"**Strategy + RL share one Broker.** Same accounting code, same SL/TP "
"logic, same fill semantics. An RL agent in `TradingEnv` is governed by "
"exactly the same rules as a `Strategy` in `Backtest`."
msgstr ""
"**Strategy 和 RL 共用一个 Broker**。相同的账户逻辑、相同的 SL/TP 行为、相同的成交语义。"
"`TradingEnv` 里的 RL 智能体和 `Backtest` 里的 `Strategy` 受完全一样的规则约束。"

